      "id": "claim_771e013091e044a6b9222c90baee399e",
      "statement": "On normal completion, P0 emits zero or more shared `token` events followed by `message_end` with the default `stop` reason and `trace_meta` containing the request UUID and a `https://smith.langchain.com/r/<run_id>` URL.",
