    {
      "id": "claim_bc71750d48fe4a8580e9a45dfa310a8e",
      "statement": "P0 distinguishes pre-stream schema rejection from stream-time failure: FastAPI validation rejects invalid message input, while any exception while opening the tracing scope or iterating the agent stream is converted into a shared SSE `error` event with code `agent_exception`, without adding a normal completion or trace event.",
