      "id": "claim_63a923f0881b4ee5bc46094e58d76686",
      "statement": "The chat UI is coupled to P0 through the completion/SSE boundary: it posts `{ messages, stream: true }` to the relative endpoint, its rewrite defaults `/v1/*` to localhost port 8000, and it recognizes the same closed six-event vocabulary used by `common.ui_bridge`.",
